{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa in San Francisco", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Hidden Gem", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Future Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Future to talk about actions in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">will</span> goes before the verb. The short form is <span class=\"strong\">'ll</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Future when you talk about intentions, make offers or make predictions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the future, technology will be even more powerful than it is today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "People will have private robots.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They will do almost everything from home.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Yesterday, we visited Pier 39.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There were Christmas carolers everywhere. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We walked around the grounds of Golden Gate Park in the afternoon. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.</br> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.</br> Irregular verbs change in different ways.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask ... ?</span></br> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to visit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"visited\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to walk\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"walked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to stop\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stopped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to lose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lost\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was, were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to speak\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"spoke\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"thought\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "conservatory", "type": "name"}, {"content": "museum of plants and flowers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We stopped in the Conversatory of Flowers. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when you talk about places in a city.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pier", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a wooden structure attached to land that allows you to walk a short way out over a body of water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The pier is a nice place to see the city.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bay", "type": "name"}, {"content": "part of a sea or ocean that is partly enclosed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have a great view of the bay from here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "grounds", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a park or the land surrounding a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We walked around the grounds of Golden Gate Park in the afternoon. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "boutique", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small store that sells specialized products", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Pier 39 has all kinds of specialty boutiques and cool restaurants.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hidden gem", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a special place in a city that not many people know about", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Pier 39 is a hidden gem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le04ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online. Do a search for hidden gems (special places) in your city. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one other city. Do another search for hidden gems in that city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short paragraph of 40-50 words about the two places. How are they the same? How are they different?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I search for hidden gems in my city and other city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 40-50 words about special places.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use correct punctuation and capital letters to start sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph to a partner about hidden gems.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le04ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi John!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hi there!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>:  Hi guys!  How is San Francisco?"}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob09re2img07.jpg", "time": "4500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's great. I love it here.  Yesterday, we visited the pier. We checked out some boutiques and saw cool restaurants. You have a great view of the bay from the end of Pier 39. It's a hidden gem.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Nice. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We walked around the grounds of Golden Gate Park in the afternoon. We stopped at a conservatory of flowers.  There were lots of Christmas poinsettias."}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "27500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Then, we went into a museum of space and technology. Did you know that in the future, technology will be even more powerful than it is today? People will have private robots and they will do almost everything from home!</br>\n<span class=\"str